# Local development secrets for `wrangler dev` (worker/).
# Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (which is git-ignored) and fill in real values.
# NEVER commit `.dev.vars` or any real key. In production these are set with
# `npx wrangler secret put <NAME>`, never in wrangler.toml.

# ISBNdb API key — OPTIONAL. Without it, ISBN lookups via ISBNdb are skipped;
# the other 5 sources (CrossRef, OpenAlex, Open Library, OpenAIRE, Internet
# Archive) still work. Get a key at https://isbndb.com/
ISBNDB_API_KEY=
